  "description": "The 1% Club World Challenge – Can YOU Beat the Odds?\n\nThe official game based on the hit TV gameshow!\n\nFeel like a real contestant in the studio as you climb global leaderboards. No need to swot up on general knowledge — this game is all about logic, reasoning, and thinking differently.\n\nFun for all ages! With this game, an 8-year-old has as much chance of winning as an 80-year-old — it’s fun for all the family.\n\n - Play the official gameshow loved by millions\n - Challenge players worldwide\n - Climb multiple international leaderboards\n - Track your progress with detailed stats\n - Enjoy hundreds of unique questions with explanations\n - Experience authentic 3D studio visuals\n - Hear the iconic music and sounds from the show\n\nAre you ready to join The 1% Club? Download now and prove you belong at the top!",
